1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,700
Dante: Fun fact. The mall has everything.
We live there now.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:08,883
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part two of ten: the mall.

3
00:00:09,203 --> 00:00:12,098
Priya: Dante. A mall has forty entrances.

4
00:00:12,418 --> 00:00:15,564
Dante: Beds. Food. A pretzel stand.

5
00:00:15,684 --> 00:00:18,567
Priya: And forty doors. And a very loud
echo.

6
00:00:18,887 --> 00:00:21,710
Dante: ...Fine. But the pretzels were a
good idea.

7
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:25,781
Rosa: Lakeside Mall. Every light is on.
Every single one.

8
00:00:26,101 --> 00:00:29,109
Dante: June. Grab a cart. We shop.

9
00:00:29,229 --> 00:00:30,979
June: I always wanted a cart, dear.

10
00:00:31,299 --> 00:00:33,064
June: The cart is very loud, dear.

11
00:00:33,184 --> 00:00:34,861
Dante: Why is the music playing?

12
00:00:35,181 --> 00:00:37,285
Teddy: Gary says the mall is a giant echo
box.

13
00:00:37,605 --> 00:00:42,808
Priya: Real rule. Small and quiet beats
big and loud.

14
00:00:43,128 --> 00:00:45,627
Steve: Excuse me. Is there a sale?

15
00:00:45,747 --> 00:00:48,779
Rosa: Everything's free, Steve. It's an
apocalypse.

16
00:00:49,099 --> 00:00:50,846
June: I still want the cart, dear.

17
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:54,162
Walt: Mmm. Is it Sunday?

18
00:00:54,482 --> 00:00:59,571
BUS-E: Radio signal found. It says: Safe
Zone twelve. All are welcome. Cozy!

19
00:00:59,891 --> 00:01:06,629
BUS-E: Part two of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the horn. Follow for part three.

